WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.470
Tickets & check-in: public ticketed events: sessions, capacity, ticket sales in DMs, orders and entry.

2
00:00:10.016 --> 00:00:16.440
Click "New public event" and set the price, "Total capacity per session" and "Sessions".

3
00:00:16.985 --> 00:00:22.860
When ready, turn on "Tickets on sale"; the assistant sells tickets in DMs.

4
00:00:23.406 --> 00:00:31.600
Under "Orders & tickets", see sales, "Orders awaiting payment" and "Ticket revenue"; sell at the door with "Desk sale".

5
00:00:32.152 --> 00:00:38.410
Cancelling a ticket frees the seat; set the cancellation fee and deadline in "Event settings".
